{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"h":0.015603328243469439,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11729846954345705,"c":1,"x":0.071740909356761806,"y":0.043070428776810332},{"t":"MARKING THE PRACTICE TESTS","x":0.07597534795533481,"y":0.089970501472637521,"c":1,"h":0.016224188790560423,"w":0.4353182983398437},{"h":0.017499313804604011,"c":1,"w":0.25256673177083333,"t":"Listening and Reading","y":0.12645348838722315,"x":0.073921972779361203},{"t":"The answer keys are on pages 120-127.","x":0.073826247474551202,"y":0.15085304925332821,"w":0.37595128377278647,"h":0.018429609315585238,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Each question in the Listening and Reading tests is worth one mark.","y":0.16804217730438309,"w":0.62023874918619804,"h":0.018895008008388614,"x":0.073865258356893781},{"h":0.0160235300879914,"w":0.5400410461425782,"x":0.075975370042003526,"c":1,"y":0.20639534895089251,"t":"Questions which require letter \/ Roman numeral answers"},{"y":0.22717331183382761,"w":0.82148289998372404,"t":"For questions where the answers are letters or Roman numerals, you should write only the","h":0.018594884169136905,"x":0.073859569322616114,"c":1},{"h":0.016012382507324174,"c":1,"x":0.073921971354010629,"w":0.80492813110351569,"y":0.24563953499812385,"t":"number of answers required. For example, if the answer is a single letter or numeral, you"},{"h":0.017449578141744193,"x":0.073921972714975276,"y":0.26308139536509634,"w":0.83778233846028638,"t":"should write only one answer. If you have written more letters or numerals than are required,","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.073803980580711553,"w":0.32469843546549482,"y":0.28212434240101336,"h":0.015946093984058107,"t":"the answer must be marked wrong."},{"y":0.31692628509492693,"w":0.62445053100585945,"c":1,"t":"Questions which require answers in the form of words or numbers","h":0.01972015966004681,"x":0.075869455311513012},{"t":"• Answers may be written in upper or lower case.","x":0.071868585096142301,"y":0.34156976755550161,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"w":0.4640657043457031},{"w":0.65092402140299488,"x":0.071868584734847515,"c":1,"y":0.35899705002402071,"t":"• Words in brackets are optional - they are correct, but not necessary.","h":0.016002949852507387},{"h":0.017486694358443078,"c":1,"w":0.47036051432291665,"t":"• Alternative answers are separated by a slash (\/).","x":0.073848327704953601,"y":0.37629553550114347},{"t":"• If you are asked to write an answer using a certain number of words and\/or (a) number(s),","y":0.39380530962519733,"w":0.84599589029947908,"h":0.017531899646320181,"x":0.071868584638586697,"c":1},{"h":0.019447549465483327,"y":0.41071517286893555,"t":"you will be penalised if you exceed this. For example, if a question specifies an answer","c":1,"w":0.788651377360026,"x":0.10054298349711985},{"t":"using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS and the correct answer is 'black leather coat',","x":0.10266940440858473,"h":0.017533614572170619,"w":0.78850102742513017,"c":1,"y":0.42877906978322911},{"x":0.10061602493502111,"h":0.016020957699215965,"w":0.41273099263509117,"c":1,"t":"the answer 'coat of black leather' is incorrect.","y":0.44622093019043618},{"h":0.019359190274128801,"t":"• In questions where you are expected to complete a gap, you should only transfer the","x":0.073860213452872289,"c":1,"y":0.46466912272674454,"w":0.79479029337565099},{"c":1,"t":"necessary missing word(s) onto the answer sheet. For example, to complete 'in the ...',","x":0.10255840177511696,"w":0.79691711425781242,"y":0.48204127766588734,"h":0.020896439003733502},{"w":0.77231445312499991,"c":1,"t":"where the correct answer is 'morning', the answer 'in the morning' would be incorrect.","x":0.10252015973680055,"h":0.023537850168953933,"y":0.49743872745344153},{"w":0.62023712158203126,"h":0.018526198800686178,"c":1,"x":0.073859284797168523,"t":"• All answers require correct spelling (including words in brackets).","y":0.51875010953413592},{"w":0.7208248901367188,"x":0.073876974204237347,"h":0.018092812619729726,"t":"• Both US and UK spelling are acceptable and are included in the answer key.","y":0.53625474949901974,"c":1},{"h":0.018147147299617528,"x":0.07385294344005558,"y":0.5543507449060372,"c":1,"t":"• All standard alternatives for numbers, dates and currencies are acceptable.","w":0.71060307820638025},{"x":0.073921965459038244,"y":0.5740412978001509,"w":0.42094456990559892,"t":"• All standard abbreviations are acceptable.","c":1,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"t":"• You will find additional notes about individual answers in the answer key.","w":0.68798583984374995,"h":0.016010680522187237,"c":1,"y":0.59013420745867629,"x":0.073877736525619853},{"x":0.074936961690070775,"t":"Writing","y":0.61967704695226022,"h":0.020499503436693378,"c":1,"w":0.084374033610026045},{"h":0.016008094630058589,"c":1,"t":"The sample answers are on pages 128-138. It is not possible for you to give yourself a mark","x":0.075975366949051784,"w":0.839835713704427,"y":0.64534883732346304},{"h":0.015991802271840161,"y":0.66424418616198277,"c":1,"x":0.073921965151616392,"t":"for the Writing tasks. We have provided sample answers (written by candidates), showing","w":0.81108830769856777},{"y":0.68023255816720318,"t":"their score and the examiners' comments. Additional sample and model answers can be","c":1,"x":0.078028756679844657,"h":0.014534883302221524,"w":0.79260777791341142},{"c":1,"t":"downloaded from the Resource Bank. These sample and model answers will give you an","w":0.80082132975260423,"y":0.70058139508503436,"h":0.013081395872223012,"x":0.078028760071700745},{"w":0.43132441202799487,"c":1,"y":0.717366317072897,"h":0.016815190047992701,"t":"insight into what is required for the Writing test.","x":0.073863678800792393},{"y":0.9186046513702989,"x":0.075975358982388469,"w":0.016427105267842607,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"8"}]}